ase, texlive-kpathsea\n- Remove texlive-sfmath as it\'s part of texlive-2024</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Than Ngo &lt;than@redhat.com&gt; - 13:20240311-7" date="1752580800">- Fix RHEL-103309, add missing tikzfill and listingsutf8, which are required by texlive-tcolorbox</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Yaakov Selkowitz &lt;yselkowi@redhat.com&gt; - 13:20240311-8" date="1757505600">- cweb requires iftex</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Than Ngo &lt;than@redhat.com&gt; - 13:20240311-9" date="1764072000">- Fix rhbz#2406165, FC-2582 - Add texlive-pict2e\n- Fix FC-2612 - Add texlive-ellipse</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Than Ngo &lt;than@redhat.com&gt; - 13:20240311-10" date="1773230400">- Fix rhbz#2423715, Add xltabular.sty, ltablex.sty, opensans.sty and slantsc.sty</changelog>\n</package>\n')
